<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97834" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύγκλῠς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠδος</span>,
			ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>washed together</i> by the waves;
			but only metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύγκλυδες ἄνθρωποι</span>
			<i>promiscuous crowd, mob, rabble</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.5
			</span></i>; 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύγκλυδες</span> alone, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				569a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				4.2.1
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ὅμιλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Mar.</u>
					45
				</span></i>
			: with neut. Subst., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκλύδων καὶ μιγάδων ἠθῶν ἀνάπλεοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.312
				</span></i>
			: <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> cites a neut. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύγκλυδα</span>.</div>
